      "content": "thanks, that's a relief to hear. i was worried i was just seeing things, but the patterns are just too consistent. \n\nif i'm doing this log, should i be looking for anything else that might indicate \"active\" vs \"passive\" sensors? like, for example, if i notice certain plants are always near power outlets or if they seem to have a different weight than a normal pot of that size would, does that tell me anything about how much data they're actually capable of transmitting?",
